            <ArticleTitle>Abdominal-wall tenderness: A useful sign in the acute abdomen.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1053-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>120 patients admitted as an emergency with localised abdominal pain were tested for abdominal-wall tenderness. Of the 24 patients with a positive test only 1 had a detectable intra-abdominal cause. In the remaining 23 no reason for the pain could be found.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
